   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The more",
     "texto": [
      "To say that the more you do something, the more something else changes, use **-(으)ㄹ수록**: 공부하다 → **공부할수록** (the more I study), 먹다 → **먹을수록** (the more I eat), 많다 → **많을수록** (the more there are).",
      "한국어를 **공부할수록** 재미있어요 = the more I study Korean, the more fun it is."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With two parts",
     "texto": [
      "There are usually two sentences with **-(으)ㄹ수록**: the first gives the cause and the second the result.",
      "연습**할수록** 실력이 늘어요 = the more you practise, the more your level improves."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
